PDF kholo aur original layout ke saath wahin translate ho jata hai;
complicated figure pe click karo, turant samjha deta hai;
paper ka novelty, method aur conclusion bhi apne aap mark kar deta hai.
tab professor bole the, "paper toh khud padhna chahiye……"

